// CLD-0002 | Step 3: Who received the phishing emails?
// Keeps the most recent message per recipient, so the row count equals
// the number of employees targeted (40 records).
CloudoraMsgTrace_CL
| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by RecipientAddress
| project TimeGenerated, RecipientAddress, Campaign, SenderIP,
          SPFResult, DKIMResult, DMARCResult
